=head1 DESCRIPTION

Settings container for integrating IAM Identity Center with OpenSearch
UI applications, which enables enabling secure user authentication and
access control across multiple data sources. This setup supports single
sign-on (SSO) through IAM Identity Center, allowing centralized user
management.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 EnabledAPIAccess => Bool

Indicates whether IAM Identity Center is enabled for the application.


=head2 IdentityCenterApplicationARN => Str

The ARN of the IAM Identity Center application that integrates with
Amazon OpenSearch Service.


=head2 IdentityCenterInstanceARN => Str

The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the IAM Identity Center instance.


=head2 IdentityStoreId => Str

The identifier of the IAM Identity Store.


=head2 RolesKey => Str

Specifies the attribute that contains the backend role identifier (such
as group name or group ID) in IAM Identity Center.


=head2 SubjectKey => Str

Specifies the attribute that contains the subject identifier (such as
username, user ID, or email) in IAM Identity Center.



